[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:A Small Blue Case]
[00:00.68]Lesson 97 | 第97课
[00:02.58]A small blue case | 一个蓝色小箱子
[00:06.05]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.17]Does Mr. Hall get his case back? | 霍尔先生拿回他的箱子了吗？
[00:17.44]I left a suitcase on the train to London the other day. | 前几天我把一个手提箱忘在去伦敦的火车上了。
[00:23.88]Can you describe it, sir? | 先生，您能描述一下它吗？
[00:27.50]It's a small blue case and it's got a zip. | 那是一个蓝色小箱子，有拉链。
[00:33.10]There's a label on the handle with my name and address on it. | 把手上有一个标签，上面有我的姓名和地址。
[00:40.19]Is this case yours? | 这个箱子是您的吗？
[00:42.71]No, that's not mine. | 不，那不是我的。
[00:45.73]What about this one? | 这个呢？
[00:48.18]This one's got a label. | 这个上面有标签。
[00:51.24]Let me see it. | 让我看看。
[00:53.37]What's your name and address? | 您的姓名和地址是什么？
[00:57.18]David Hall, 83, Bridge Street. | 大卫·霍尔，桥街83号。
[01:02.44]That's right. | 对。
[01:03.94]D. N. Hall, 83, Bridge Street. | D. N. 霍尔，桥街83号。
[01:09.47]Three pounds fifty pence, please. | 请付三英镑五十便士。
[01:13.68]Here you are. | 给你。
[01:15.28]Thank you. | 谢谢。
[01:16.70]Hey! | 嘿！
[01:17.77]What's the matter? | 怎么了？
[01:19.94]This case doesn't belong to me! | 这个箱子不是我的！
[01:24.02]You've given me the wrong case! | 你把箱子给我弄错了！